  "plain": "A podcast host, Jesse Michels, talks about the 1947 incident near Roswell, New Mexico, where something is said to have crashed and been recovered by the military. He says the official explanation has changed so many times that it is laughable, and the story's title points to one version in which bodies seen there were explained as children with progeria, a rare disease that makes the body age fast. For Michels, the shifting accounts suggest the real story is being hidden."
